flowchart TD
    %% Sources: brainstorm/00_context.md Scope, A-017, A-021, A-032, A-035,
    %% prompt-registry.lock.yml and access-control.lock.yml.

    start([Start: Prompt Owner chooses Register prompt])
    record[Enter title, purpose, tags, prompt body, and unique namespace/name]
    runtime[Select provider configuration, upstream model, generation parameters, and optional fallback answer]
    ownership[Choose one owner and initial access level; default Private]
    validate{Required fields valid and model name available?}
    invalid[Registration Validation]
    create{Create property and first immutable Draft revision}
    failed[Registration Failed]
    detail[Prompt Property Detail - Draft]
    end_registered([End: owned Draft registered; nothing shared or released automatically])

    start --> record
    record -->|Continue| runtime
    runtime -->|Continue| ownership
    ownership -->|Register| validate
    validate -->|No| invalid
    invalid -->|Correct fields| record
    validate -->|Yes| create
    create -->|Transaction fails| failed
    failed -->|Retry with form retained| ownership
    failed -->|Cancel| record
    create -->|Success| detail
    detail --> end_registered

    %% Import from Sheets, Notion, repositories, files, Drive, or chat exports is out of scope.
